The refactor tool is not available to make the method virtual for mocking. I will write the test as is, using a real HttpClient with a mocked HttpMessageHandler to intercept the SendAsync call. This will allow us to cover the call on line 263.

I will submit a test file with tests for GetResponseUncheckedAsync including a successful response and an exception case. The test will use Moq to mock HttpMessageHandler.

